                        "entry_id": "9a9c922d-e7d7-3ac6-a93f-54e5714170ce",
                        "glosses": [
                            "One skilled in the theory or construction of machines."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "dated"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "aabc8db7-5a5f-4d14-b359-3e8289bb30b0",
                                "sense_id": "78c2fff6-2b4c-3df2-b767-5250933c2541",
                                "text": "To build such a device will require an expert mechanician."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0a57c77d-c699-4b21-9f10-2fecdd9a3d00",
                                "sense_id": "78c2fff6-2b4c-3df2-b767-5250933c2541",
                                "text": "The Cotton-Gin is a machine to separate the seeds from cotton, invented by that celebrated mechanician, E. Whitney. -- from the 1828 Webster's Dictionary."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fdfc9371-a359-496a-a6a5-f6498a1923c1",
                                "sense_id": "78c2fff6-2b4c-3df2-b767-5250933c2541",
                                "text": "The Yankees, the first mechanicians in the world, are engineers—just as the Italians are musicians and the Germans metaphysicians—by right of birth."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cb49b7f1-e8ed-444d-94b3-0193bac34007",
                                "sense_id": "78c2fff6-2b4c-3df2-b767-5250933c2541",
                                "text": "a'''1891, Constance Garnett (translator), Leo Tolstoy (author), Anna Karenin, in The Harvard Classics Shelf of Fiction, P.F. Collier & son (1917), page 214,\n\"The mechanician came when I was away; I haven't seen him yet,\" he said, not looking at her."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
