                                "sense_id": "87f09aa2-0f3a-312c-a3ab-500462e58671",
                                "text": "Shortly after being removed to the hospital Wright recovered consciousness and sent for Taylor, his mechanician. -- \"Fatal fall of Wright airship\", New York Times September 18th 1908"
